                "caption": "Figure 2:Joint system-latency calibration apparatus and signal-acquisition workflow.The RealSense camera records a visual time code on the display and an end-effector ArUco marker, while the host logs image timestamps, receipt times, joint commands, and proprioceptive feedback. Timestamp differences and phase relationships among periodic signals estimate the camera timestamp offset, image-readout latency, motion-response latency, and proprioceptive-feedback latency.",
